      "message": "This will introduce 1 second delay.\nI\u0027m not familiar with this code but I guess this means, NETWORK_STATS_UPDATED broadcast will be delivered 1 second after the stats are updated.\nDo we have any concern for this behavior change?\n\nBTW, is it expected that performPollLocked is called this frequently? what triggers performPollLocked?",
